    "title": "One Finger Inside the Open C Chord",
    "summary": "Moving one finger inside the open C chord makes it minor on three of its six strings — and turns it into something else entirely if the other two keep ringing.",
    "tags": ["triads", "chords", "fretboard"],
    "readingTimeMin": 3,
