  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Two sets in, and the rule hasn't flinched. Strings 3-4-5 hold one more test, and this one arrives with a bonus: the middle of the guitar is also where a chord you've fingered for years is already sitting. Root position sits at the bottom of this set, same as it did for major."
        }
      ]
